  <item>
    <title>1. 🇮🇱 捣腾 38 个产品后，去做了自己最害怕的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6370b560a5004aa3aa5714d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6370b560a5004aa3aa5714d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Nov 2022 09:14:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>本期嘉宾：</span></em><a href="https://speechify.com/about/?landing_url=https%3A%2F%2Fspeechify.com%2Fabout%2F" data-url="https://speechify.com/about/?landing_url=https%3A%2F%2Fspeechify.com%2Fabout%2F"><em><span>Cliff Weitzman</span></em></a><em><span>, CEO &amp; Founder @ Speechify</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Cliff 从小患有失读症，无法阅读。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在布朗念书时，他自学编程，写了一款文字转语音软件，来辅助自己阅读理解。毕业后，持续优化成品，发布了 Speechify，一款目前ARR千万美金的语音阅读器。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在创业赛道选择，不少人都会迷茫。面对迷茫，Cliff的回答是：做你小时候最让你害怕的事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">1:42</a>: 在布朗大学念书时捣腾38个产品</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">3:22</a>: Speechify的起源</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">5:53</a>: 如何验证Speechify的市场需求</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">7:26</a>: 为自己代言，Cliff自制的13M播放量的油管广告</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">8:55</a>: 为什么坚持做这个不“性感”的产品？Speechify早期困难</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a>: Speechify 如何帮 Cliff 寻找人生意义</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>: 管理恐惧和不确定性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a>: 如何把Speechify打造一支不受地域限制的全球团队</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsrgliOJaRMwgu8QO1Jxwi9hgEc7.m4a" length="15648543" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:25</itunes:duration>
